    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kimbow Escape</strong> is a 2D platform game that challenges you to face your skills against different styles of traps and enemies inside a prison that at all costs does not want you to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/7f0ebc64f5cce6a167055601f4e023bf.avif?t=1744599454\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Main Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>10 Challenging Levels</strong></u> - Moving platforms and traps with enemies everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Use your skills</strong></u> - Attack, Shield, Double Jump and Dash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/3b07980ab9611c4fd96b91ec36ad68c4.poster.avif?t=1744599454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/3b07980ab9611c4fd96b91ec36ad68c4.webm?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/3b07980ab9611c4fd96b91ec36ad68c4.mp4?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/a8613cfb4261f831d2eb6846961aab11.poster.avif?t=1744599454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/a8613cfb4261f831d2eb6846961aab11.webm?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/a8613cfb4261f831d2eb6846961aab11.mp4?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/227b97feb8cb17b13fc14c8c47c24d3d.poster.avif?t=1744599454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/227b97feb8cb17b13fc14c8c47c24d3d.webm?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/227b97feb8cb17b13fc14c8c47c24d3d.mp4?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/54e6a6e835d3d7b2453543e7cdb11c7b.poster.avif?t=1744599454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/54e6a6e835d3d7b2453543e7cdb11c7b.webm?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/54e6a6e835d3d7b2453543e7cdb11c7b.mp4?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unique Special Ability</strong></u> - Use your invulnerability ability to help you against more challenging enemies to manage your time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/a3f1ee7c69bd0e6f5ef3a66d518f3440.poster.avif?t=1744599454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/a3f1ee7c69bd0e6f5ef3a66d518f3440.webm?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470070/extras/a3f1ee7c69bd0e6f5ef3a66d518f3440.mp4?t=1744599454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>10 Soundtracks</strong></u> - Exciting sound effects with each new background change</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Achievement Challenge</strong></u> - Recover achievements by collecting coins and others hidden throughout the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Time Challenge</strong></u> - Fight against the clock, if you don't find your hourglass your time runs out and you are defeated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Boss Challenge</strong></u> - Face your most dangerous antagonists or escape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Xbox Controller)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forward D-Pad - Walk forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backward D-Pad - Walk backward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A - Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - (Double click while jumping) Side Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B - Shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y - Jump / Double Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RB - Dash Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LB - Special Ability</p>",
